      "writtenOn": "2018-09-06T19:05:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That doesn\u0027t look right\nsizeof(rb_secret) is CONFIG_ROLLBACK_SECRET_SIZE which can be (and actually is I think) larger than SBP_ENC_KEY_LEN",
