      "writtenOn": "2018-09-10T07:56:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, sizeof(rb_secret) is what you want:\nvoid hmac_SHA256(uint8_t *output, const uint8_t *key, const int key_len,\n                 const uint8_t *message, const int message_len);\n\nYou definitely want to use all of your rb_secret to generate your key_buf. Else you\u0027re just throwing away entropy.",
